    "describe_ch": "課程著重在化學平衡反應與反應動力學和熱力學，再以熱力學觀念說明電化學原理，課程涵蓋有機化學介紹以及無機金屬與配位化學，強化材料主修學生之化學能力。",
    "describe_eh": "Optical include Properties of Solutions , Chemical Kinetics, Chemical Equilibrium, Acids and Bases, Applications of Aqueous Equilibria, Spontaneity, Entropy, and Free Energy, Electro Chemistry, Transition Metals and Coordination Chemistry, Organic Chemistry.\r\n\r\n",
